  "description": "A kindergarten where superpowers are a daily occurrence. The temporary teacher who was assigned here, Oh Sae-Ong, has no superpowers, no experience, and no physical strength. He endures each day among the children who light fires, call for water, and see the future, and gradually learns about their world. A kindergarten routine that is more special than special abilities, Super Power! Care Diary\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
